{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23983","headline":"早饮醉中除河南尹敕到 · 白居易","name":"早饮醉中除河南尹敕到","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪拥衡门水满池，温炉卯後煖寒时。\n绿醅新酎尝初醉，黄纸除书到不知。\n厚俸自来诚忝滥，老身欲起尚迟疑。\n应须了却丘中计，女嫁男婚三迳资。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}